preting that letter to the practical record of who shared Thorsen's patrol."},{["episodeID"]="authored-kurzen-spy-4",["requiresAll"]={{["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=200},{["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=215},{["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=328},{["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=329},{["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=330},{["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=331}},["role"]="ending",["sourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"215:description:1-28","215:description:31-79","215:description:84-228","215:description:231-313","215:description:316-360","215:description:365-419","215:description:422-465","215:objective:1-46"},["questID"]=215,["sourceHash"]="fbe14e337078fcb1e0c4ca59494548a785d84812ba8b79f9f42a3dfad039058c",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},{["atomIDs"]={"200:description:1-66","200:description:69-112","200:description:117-172","200:description:175-270","200:description:273-362","200:description:367-470","200:description:473-509","200:objective:1-28"},["questID"]=200,["sourceHash"]="9d6ace0a44c51e98d5efaf6a4f130d433ee953ed8c61f08c1694d972b98f826e",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},{["atomIDs"]={"328:description:1-145","328:description:150-263","328:description:266-361","328:description:366-506","328:objective:1-57"},["questID"]=328,["sourceHash"]="f259674e565acee60c5e9d7f49dac04afad37742d93928efba5971981e736abf",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},{["atomIDs"]={"329:description:1-64","329:description:67-139","329:description:142-233","329:description:236-272","329:description:277-343","329:description:346-406","329:objective:1-58"},["questID"]=329,["sourceHash"]="16edeb03b757cad0c36dd4308dfd92f15895887b3dd6d470f804440995b28658",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},{["atomIDs"]={"330:description:1-80","330:description:85-165","330:description:168-235","330:description:240-262","330:description:265-334","330:objective:1-28"},["questID"]=330,["sourceHash"]="e6f4dd6b41b54d1d7edd0066dd826d1d80451ae3d458eba2b33584f54a8f64bd",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},{["atomIDs"]={"331:completion:1-53","331:completion:55-127","331:completion:129-254"},["questID"]=331,["sourceHash"]="4e69a83b2d36ac92d0f99b10c29f451cf4c1621d754d2c4f89f84cb5ded32557",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"}},["text"]="The patrol information identified Merle. Doren remembered a brave soldier and regretted the betrayal, but discovery ended the spy's secrecy at a moment when the rebels could scarcely afford it."}},["grouping"]="SOURCE_CONNECTED_ARC_WITH_BRANCHES",["quests"]={215,200,328,329,330,331},["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["sourceConflict"]=false,["title"]="The observer inside the camp"},["authored-scythe"]={["authored"]=true,["branchHandling"]={},["completionRequirements"]={["expression"]={["allOf"]={{["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=1022,["sourceHash"]="4fe69627c8f14167520b33490bfb87409d6131fc422eb44d1b15ac13bf105937"},{["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=1037,["sourceHash"]="8a2b7b425fcbaf37a149d166158bae0a8c952bcf77356c4d2447c87d9807966d"},{["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=1038,["sourceHash"]="17d1e5b45f1d06b1944c1a607131a3a6b29cb67a1adee68e28568f4c6a73dbf8"},{["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=1039,["sourceHash"]="9453950ade5e0e5d1bb72cec7c4266a46fd4d239c08243bce5e9904270c84f88"},{["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=1040,["sourceHash"]="66d6a7cbcd96a011e9cc0ae788aef582de3efc482cdf8fe37abb5950cc1b113b"},{["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=1041,["sourceHash"]="c41f436fb1f317d3596d95d1e65f87acc12f4e8ef63957f81a0c45574e0037d0"},{["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=1042,["sourceHash"]="e7f186dcb8514eb9bf11381bdcf3d0eee31e8072432117cc7c998229d6386a29"},{["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=1043,["sourceHash"]="754cdaf2e426eadfc20ae6e47840d28ac79dbf94072b38f332d33ca1311ff769"},{["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=1044,["sourceHash"]="896780139289ceb128692f3dbd445a3f09add2165e7ace280d19d3d0223bc5c6"}}},["interpretation"]="Every listed leaf requires its own observed completion with a matching source hash. This editorial route clause does not infer gameplay all-of prerequisites from previousID arrays.",["scope"]="OBSERVED_SOURCE_ROUTE_AND_DEFINED_OUTCOME"},["episodes"]={{["episodeID"]="authored-scythe-1",["requiresAll"]={{["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1022}},["role"]="opening",["sourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1022:description:1-143","1022:description:145-214","1022:description:219-333","1022:description:335-405","1022:description:407-502","1022:objective:1-118"},["questID"]=1022,["sourceHash"]="4fe69627c8f14167520b33490bfb87409d6131fc422eb44d1b15ac13bf105937",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"}},["text"]="Calls from wolf-men gave the ruined shrine its new name, the Howling Vale. Melyria sought an explanation in the tome left there, beginning with a local mystery beside the pressured Felwood border."},{["episodeID"]="authored-scythe-2",["requiresAll"]={{["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1022},{["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1037},{["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1038}},["role"]="progression",["sourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1022:description:1-143","1022:description:145-214","1022:description:219-333","1022:description:335-405","1022:description:407-502","1022:objective:1-118"},["questID"]=1022,["sourceHash"]="4fe69627c8f14167520b33490bfb87409d6131fc422eb44d1b15ac13bf105937",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},{["atomIDs"]={"1037:description:1-61","1037:description:63-171","1037:description:173-204","1037:description:209-245","1037:description:247-298","1037:description:300-438","1037:description:443-500","1037:objective:1-70"},["questID"]=1037,["sourceHash"]="8a2b7b425fcbaf37a149d166158bae0a8c952bcf77356c4d2447c87d9807966d",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},{["atomIDs"]={"1038:description:1-41","1038:description:43-121","1038:description:123-219","1038:description:221-311","1038:description:316-443","1038:description:445-502","1038:objective:1-119"},["questID"]=1038,["sourceHash"]="17d1e5b45f1d06b1944c1a607131a3a6b29cb67a1adee68e28568f4c6a73dbf8",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"}},["text"]="The inquiry turned toward Velinde, whose disappearance the Sentinels could not explain. They allowed a search of her belongings while still trusting that she had reasons for leaving and might return."},{["episodeID"]="authored-scythe-3",["requiresAll"]={{["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1022},{["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1037},{["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1038},{["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1039},{["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1040},{["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1041}},["role"]="progression",["sourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1022:description:1-143","1022:description:145-214","1022:description:219-333","1022:description:335-405","1022:description:407-502","1022:objective:1-118"},["questID"]=1022,["sourceHash"]="4fe69627c8f14167520b33490bfb87409d6131fc422eb44d1b15ac13bf105937",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},{["atomIDs"]={"1037:description:1-61","1037:description:63-171","1037:description:173-204","1037:description:209-245","1037:description:247-298","1037:description:300-438","1037:description:443-500","1037:objective:1-70"},["questID"]=1037,["sourceHash"]="8a2b7b425fcbaf37a149d166158bae0a8c952bcf77356c4d2447c87d9807966d",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},{["atomIDs"]={"1038:description:1-41","1038:description:43-121","1038:description:123-219","1038:description:221-311","1038:description:316-443","1038:description:445-502","1038:objective:1-119"},["questID"]=1038,["sourceHash"]="17d1e5b45f1d06b1944c1a607131a3a6b29cb67a1adee68e28568f4c6a73dbf8",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},{["atomIDs"]={