lliance162→4493 and4508→4510, or Horde32→4494 and4509→4511. Both factions are never required. Source previous/following edges do not imply an unlisted live prerequisite or current availability.",["scope"]="OBSERVED_FACTION_INVESTIGATION_THROUGH_FINAL_GRATITUDE_RECEIPT"},["episodes"]={{["episodeID"]="authored-silithid-investigation-1",["requiresAll"]={{["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=992}},["role"]="opening",["sourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"992:description:1-117","992:description:122-206","992:description:209-300","992:description:305-393","992:description:396-442","992:description:445-496","992:objective:1-75","992:objective:78-191"},["questID"]=992,["sourceHash"]="862dfe2f6daf4c3f37b5d27b08a2ed55b6b4024d32a0a0872605727981f8319a",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"}},["text"]="Gadgetzan's need for water began with contested wells and the search for another pool. A dowsing widget and a sample near Sandsorrow Watch offered a way to survey the desert despite the nomads' hold on the company's wells."},{["episodeID"]="authored-silithid-investigation-2",["requiresAll"]={{["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=10},{["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=82},{["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=992}},["role"]="progression",["sourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"992:description:1-117","992:description:122-206","992:description:209-300","992:description:305-393","992:description:396-442","992:description:445-496","992:objective:1-75","992:objective:78-191"},["questID"]=992,["sourceHash"]="862dfe2f6daf4c3f37b5d27b08a2ed55b6b4024d32a0a0872605727981f8319a",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},{["atomIDs"]={"82:description:1-46","82:description:48-144","82:description:146-190","82:description:195-234","82:description:236-317","82:description:319-412","82:description:414-466","82:objective:1-93"},["questID"]=82,["sourceHash"]="a9b7eea8fdba0e6af6d09dc0260486e73e166156a164a44c1e8c759e9afcc0d9",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},{["atomIDs"]={"10:completion:1-39","10:completion:42-143","10:completion:148-228","10:completion:231-408","10:completion:411-494"},["questID"]=10,["sourceHash"]="6f42d017d4c43e4e6b15e3b5573d895ca3bea867a7fdad1b190cc6cecbefaadd",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"}},["text"]="Scrimshank's loss made the investigation personal. The surviving gear suggested creatures too coordinated to dismiss as ordinary insects, while an outside controlling force remained a hypothesis."},{["episodeID"]="authored-silithid-investigation-3",["requiresAll"]={{["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=10},{["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=82},{["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=110},{["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=113},{["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=992}},["role"]="progression",["sourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"992:description:1-117","992:description:122-206","992:description:209-300","992:description:305-393","992:description:396-442","992:description:445-496","992:objective:1-75","992:objective:78-191"},["questID"]=992,["sourceHash"]="862dfe2f6daf4c3f37b5d27b08a2ed55b6b4024d32a0a0872605727981f8319a",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},{["atomIDs"]={"82:description:1-46","82:description:48-144","82:description:146-190","82:description:195-234","82:description:236-317","82:description:319-412","82:description:414-466","82:objective:1-93"},["questID"]=82,["sourceHash"]="a9b7eea8fdba0e6af6d09dc0260486e73e166156a164a44c1e8c759e9afcc0d9",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},{["atomIDs"]={"10:description:1-26","10:description:29-119","10:description:122-161","10:description:164-250","10:description:253-322","10:description:327-399","10:description:402-408","10:description:410-450","10:description:453-504","10:objective:1-142"},["questID"]=10,["sourceHash"]="6f42d017d4c43e4e6b15e3b5573d895ca3bea867a7fdad1b190cc6cecbefaadd",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},{["atomIDs"]={"110:description:1-76","110:description:78-126","110:description:129-235","110:description:240-364","110:description:367-401","110:objective:1-81"},["questID"]=110,["sourceHash"]="663114c7599e2bc5bbe1ce87f1fbcfe84eaa84185111deacc0f939f6e4b3df30",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},{["atomIDs"]={"113:description:1-66","113:description:69-79","113:description:81-127","113:description:130-262","113:description:265-363","113:description:368-464","113:description:466-502","113:objective:1-64","113:objective:67-147"},["questID"]=113,["sourceHash"]="e3adcaf88fe30077acbfa587616aa04cc718d2096df92e61be066efc6db6571c",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"}},["text"]="Pestlezugg's analysis became an urgent warning. He wanted the report delivered at once and copied for wider circulation, fearing that a threat already reaching beyond Tanaris might spread across Azeroth."},{["episodeID"]="authored-silithid-investigation-alliance-first-report",["requiresAll"]={{["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=162}},["role"]="progression",["sourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"162:description:1-90","162:description:95-150","162:description:153-267","162:description:270-394","162:description:397-416","162:description:421-499","162:objective:1-68","162:completion:1-14","162:completion:16-64","162:completion:67-117","162:completion:122-254","162:completion:257-306","162:completion:309-445","162:completion:450-497"},["questID"]=162,["sourceHash"]="efb8fb8b657513aa7030b3849e75d1dbc1e3c37e014f606063f3dc4003768aee",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"}},["text"]="Gracina recognized the insects as silithid and feared their advance through Tanaris. She described them as instruments of a greater threat, turning the report toward a wider investigation."},{["episodeID"]="authored-silithid-investigation-horde-first-report",["requiresAll"]={{["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=32}},["role"]="progression",["sourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"32:description:1-19","32:description:22-109","32:description:114-163","32:description:166-278","32:description:281-391","32:description:394-437","32:description:442-506","32:objective:1-50","32:completion:1-14","32:completion:16-51","32:completion:53-87","32:completion:89-103","32:completion:108-240","32:completion:242-291","32:completion:293-429","32:completion:434-481"},["questID"]=32,["sourceHash"]="4576f238d321b1c485b227eeea1449f549a4df4ad87077696a8dfd14daf7d3b8",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"}},["text"]="Zilzibin recognized the silithid in the report. He feared their spread across Tanaris and regretted that their place within a greater threat had not been understood earlier."},{["episodeID"]="authored-silithid-investigation-alliance-crater-theory",["requiresAll"]={{["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=4493}},["role"]="progression",["sourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"4493:description:1-133","4493:description:136-233","4493:description:238-285","4493:description:288-363","4493:description:366-437","4493:description:440-509","4493:objective:1-43"},["questID"]=4493,["sourceHash"]="f53d7f4ea7f30d800d66a033cffaea7329ca191a902f7604ad90a9c78c98b291",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"}},["text"]="Gracina's theory pointed beyond the desert to Un'Goro Crater as a possible source of the silithid's strength. She sent word to Pestlezugg in Gadgetzan to pursue that suspicion."},{["episodeID"]="authored-silithid-investigation-horde-crater-theory",["requiresAll"]={{["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=4494}},["role"]="progression",["sourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"4494:description:1-133","4494:description:136-233","4494:description:238-285","4494:description:288-363","4494:description:366-437","4494:description:440-509","4494:objective:1-43"},["questID"]=4494,["sourceHash"]="47327ecd80c686805b921cd94ccd7cd98b6148e9dc1a5ea8fc2da2edcbff011d",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"}},["text"]="Zilzibin suspected that the silithid's strength came from Un'Goro Crater. He directed the theory back to Pestlezugg, seeking help against a threat to life beyond the desert."},{["episodeID"]="authored-silithid-investigation-4",["requiresAll"]={{["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=10},{["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=82},{["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=110},{["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=113},{["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=992},{["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=4496},{["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=4507}},["role"]="progression",["sourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"992:description:1-117","992:description:122-206","992:description:209-300","992:description:305-393","992:description:396-442","992:description:445-496","992:objective:1-75","992:objective:78-191"},["questID"]=992,["sourceHash"]="862dfe2f6daf4c3f37b5d27b08a2ed55b6b4024d32a0a0872605727981f8319a",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},{["atomIDs"]={"82:description:1-46","82:description:48-144","82:description:146-190","82:description:195-234","82:description:236-317","82:description:319-412","82:description:414-466","82:objective:1-93"},["questID"]=82,["sourceHash"]="a9b7eea8fdba0e6af6d09dc0260486e73e166156a164a44c1e8c759e9afcc0d9",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},{["atomIDs"]={"10:description:1-26","10:description:29-119","10:description:122-161","10:description:164-250","10:description:253-322","10:description:327-399","10:description:402-408","10:description:410-450","10:description:453-504","10:objective:1-142"},["questID"]=10,["sourceHash"]="6f42d017d4c43e4e6b15e3b5573d895ca3bea867a7fdad1b190cc6cecbefaadd",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},{["atomIDs"]={"110:description:1-76","110:description:78-126","110:description:129-235","110:description:240-364","110:description:367-401","110:objec