thandol-1",["requiresAll"]={{["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=631}},["role"]="opening",["sourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"631:description:1-48","631:description:51-77","631:description:82-127","631:description:130-209","631:description:214-289","631:description:292-377","631:description:382-399","631:description:402-469","631:description:474-500","631:objective:1-48"},["questID"]=631,["sourceHash"]="e5f345727d9816cffbe80e75eec7836ce9f575d5bd7ad82911cd5251a1a04137",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"}},["text"]="The span's explosion left its defenders short of both soldiers and knowledge. Rustlocke went to examine the eastern bridge, then disappeared while the survivors were too pressed to search."},{["episodeID"]="authored-thandol-2",["requiresAll"]={{["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=631},{["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=632}},["role"]="progression",["sourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"631:description:1-48","631:description:51-77","631:description:82-127","631:description:130-209","631:description:214-289","631:description:292-377","631:description:382-399","631:description:402-469","631:description:474-500","631:objective:1-48"},["questID"]=631,["sourceHash"]="e5f345727d9816cffbe80e75eec7836ce9f575d5bd7ad82911cd5251a1a04137",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},{["atomIDs"]={"632:description:1-66","632:description:69-117","632:description:122-187","632:objective:1-88"},["questID"]=632,["sourceHash"]="b3d7813881d022bbcbfe6dd727e6eb64d6dd4fc0143c92d121bb70bc844b1d7a",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"}},["text"]="The missing scout was found dead, with a parchment beside him. Reporting a death and carrying its evidence became one task, preventing the lost man's last discovery from remaining in the ruins."},{["episodeID"]="authored-thandol-3",["requiresAll"]={{["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=631},{["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=632},{["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=633}},["role"]="progression",["sourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"631:description:1-48","631:description:51-77","631:description:82-127","631:description:130-209","631:description:214-289","631:description:292-377","631:description:382-399","631:description:402-469","631:description:474-500","631:objective:1-48"},["questID"]=631,["sourceHash"]="e5f345727d9816cffbe80e75eec7836ce9f575d5bd7ad82911cd5251a1a04137",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},{["atomIDs"]={"632:description:1-66","632:description:69-117","632:description:122-187","632:objective:1-88"},["questID"]=632,["sourceHash"]="b3d7813881d022bbcbfe6dd727e6eb64d6dd4fc0143c92d121bb70bc844b1d7a",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},{["atomIDs"]={"633:completion:1-30","633:completion:32-104","633:completion:109-177"},["questID"]=633,["sourceHash"]="cf92ea424f5d8bc8a9cf28f5e686b906050b1bb826d5918bd4d4bd0524580be0",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"}},["text"]="The cache named in the parchment was destroyed, and Rhag declared the remaining bridge saved. The relief still depended on enduring long enough for soldiers who had not arrived."},{["episodeID"]="authored-thandol-4",["requiresAll"]={{["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=631},{["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=632},{["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=633},{["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=634}},["role"]="ending",["sourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"631:description:1-48","631:description:51-77","631:description:82-127","631:description:130-209","631:description:214-289","631:description:292-377","631:description:382-399","631:description:402-469","631:description:474-500","631:objective:1-48"},["questID"]=631,["sourceHash"]="e5f345727d9816cffbe80e75eec7836ce9f575d5bd7ad82911cd5251a1a04137",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},{["atomIDs"]={"632:description:1-66","632:description:69-117","632:description:122-187","632:obje